            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
      </sec>
      <sec id="sec4" sec-type="discussion">
        <label>4</label>
        <title>Discussion</title>
        <p>The results demonstrate that streaming-based parsing offers significant advantages for large-scale biomedical text mining applications.</p>
      </sec>
